glowthread-ui-queue-context:
Shown to moderators above a reply in the filtered list, to show which comment it answers. Long text is cut off.
* $1 - author name of the comment being answered, or {{msg-mw|glowthread-ui-user-hidden}}
* $2 - plain text of the comment being answered

glowthread-ui-popular-open:
Screen-reader label for each entry in the top comments box ({{msg-mw|glowthread-ui-popular}}). Pressing the entry scrolls to the comment in the comment section, showing its conversation there, and highlights it.
* $1 - author name, or {{msg-mw|glowthread-ui-user-hidden}}
* $2 - plain text of the comment
